    "change": "Bimanual I2RT YAM station (2026-10-28): the dual-arm sparse-target direct tools without the perception services (segmentation, grounding, grasp proposals), the RoboDojo-only worker callbacks (align_plan, IK probes and reach annotations) and the wrist rotation primitives, with yam_rgbd_v1 for the overhead, front and two wrist cameras. Camera images and both arms' measured poses are delivered with each observation; per-camera calibration stays query-based (mark_point, geometry_query). The YAM layers come last and replace the inherited planner, recovery, wait and finish wording with what the YAM executor does.",
